Scoped removegrain video filter

The option table, pixel-format list, mode kernels (mode01 to mode24, with
mode1112, mode1314 and mode1516 shared), the frame-wide skip_odd/skip_even rows,
the border row and column copies and the mode-0 plane copy in
src/video-removegrain.ts and src/video-ops/removegrain.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_removegrain.c (removegrain_options, pix_fmts,
REMOVE_GRAIN_SORT_AXIS, cmp_int, mode01..mode24, config_input, filter_slice,
filter_frame).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
